---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="AC Installation | Wake Forest & Rolesville, NC" description="New AC system installation in Wake Forest and Rolesville, NC. Properly sized, code-compliant installs.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AC Installation</h1>
      <p>New AC system installation in Wake Forest and Rolesville, NC. Properly sized, code-compliant installs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Whether you're replacing an aging unit or building new, correct sizing and installation matter as much as the equipment itself. We install central and ductless systems that match your home and climate.</p>
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Load calculation for proper sizing</li>
        <li>Central split systems and package units</li>
        <li>High-efficiency and ENERGY STAR options</li>
        <li>Permit handling and code compliance</li>
        <li>Workmanship warranty on every install</li>
        <li>Same-day installs often available</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Fast Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day AC service in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and nearby communities. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>